X:1
T:Modo 1: Fa♯ Jónico (E.J. 4)
C:Taffanel & Gaubert · Adaptación Modal (Taffanel & Gaubert (págs. 111–114))
% Modo 1/7 (Mayor) | Escala mayor base | Fórmula: 1 - 2 - 3 - 4 - 5 - 6 - 7
%%barsperstaff 2
M:4/2
L:1/8
Q:1/2=80
K:F#
V:1 clef=treble
%%score 1
(FGABcdef) (gfedcBAG) | (ABcdefga) (bagfedcB) |
(cdefgabc') (d'c'bagfed) | (efgabc'd'e') (f'e'd'c'bagf) |
(efgabc'd'e') (d'c'bagfed) | (cdefgabc') (bagfedcB) |
(ABcdefga) (gfedcBAG) | (FGABcdef) (edcBAG F2) |]

X:2
T:Modo 2: Fa♯ Lidio (E.J. 4)
C:Taffanel & Gaubert · Adaptación Modal (Taffanel & Gaubert (págs. 111–114))
