%%barsperstaff 2
M:4/2
L:1/8
Q:1/2=80
K:F#
V:1 clef=treble
%%score 1
(FGA^Bcdef) (gfedcBAG) | (A^Bcdefga) (^bagfedcB) |
(cdefga^bc') (d'c'bagfed) | (efga^bc'd'e') (f'e'd'c'bagf) |
(efga^bc'd'e') (d'c'bagfed) | (cdefga^bc') (bagfedc^B) |
(A^Bcdefga) (gfedcBAG) | (FGA^Bcdef) (edcBAG F2) |]

X:3
T:Modo 3: Fa♯ Mixolidio (E.J. 4)
C:Taffanel & Gaubert · Adaptación Modal (Taffanel & Gaubert (págs. 111–114))
% Modo 3/7 (Mayor) | Séptima menor accidental: Mi♮ | Fórmula: 1 - 2 - 3 - 4 - 5 - 6 - ♭7
%%barsperstaff 2
M:4/2
L:1/8
Q:1/2=80
K:F#
V:1 clef=treble
%%score 1
(FGABcd=ef) (gfedcBAG) | (ABcd=efga) (bagfedcB) |
(cd=efgabc') (d'c'bagfed) | (=efgabc'd'=e') (f'e'd'c'bagf) |
(=efgabc'd'=e') (d'c'bagfed) | (cd=efgabc') (bagfedcB) |
(ABcd=efga) (gfedcBAG) | (FGABcd=ef) (edcBAG F2) |]

X:4
